Static inventory of run-label surfaces and current risks
- results-explorer/src/lib/runIdentity.ts owns cohort-aware base labels but returns only strings, not visible/full/aria pairs.
- results-explorer/src/components/DistributionBox.tsx uses preserveUniqueAfterTruncation, then slices labels from the end again in SVG text.
- results-explorer/src/components/CDFChart.tsx truncates legend labels with prefix-only slice(0, 14), losing date/short-id suffixes.
- results-explorer/src/components/PowerBar.tsx, ChartPanel.tsx PerformanceBar, and StackedPhase.tsx use prefix-only slice truncation.
- results-explorer/src/components/RankTable.tsx preserves uniqueness by widening to the full label when prefix truncation collides.
- results-explorer/src/components/QueryDiffTable.tsx displays candidate.platform without cohort-aware disambiguation.

